{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"WisePIM Public API","version":"1.0.0","description":"Manage your WisePIM catalogue, prompts and knowledge, and launch enrichment, translation and bulk jobs. Authenticate with `Authorization: Bearer wpk_…`; create keys under Settings → API keys. Each key is bound to one project and to the scopes it was created with."},"paths":{"/api/public/v1/me":{"get":{"operationId":"public_v1_get_me","summary":"Describe the calling key","parameters":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MeOut"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}}},"description":"The key this request authenticated with and the project it is bound to.\n\nNeeds no scope: an integration calls it to confirm which credential it is\nholding, which scopes that credential carries, and which project every\nother call will land in. The secret itself is never returned — only its\ndisplay prefix.","tags":["Account"],"security":[{"ProjectApiKeyAuth":[]}]}},"/api/public/v1/project":{"get":{"operationId":"public_v1_get_project","summary":"Read the project","parameters":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProjectOut"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}}},"description":"The project the key is bound to: identity, status, locales, industry\nand the live product count. Requires ``project:read``.","tags":["Account"],"security":[{"ProjectApiKeyAuth":[]}]}},"/api/public/v1/products":{"get":{"operationId":"public_v1_list_products","summary":"List products","parameters":[{"in":"query","name":"ids","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Ids"},"required":false},{"in":"query","name":"skus","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Skus"},"required":false},{"in":"query","name":"updated_since","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Updated Since"},"required":false},{"in":"query","name":"category_id","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Category Id"},"required":false},{"in":"query","name":"status","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Status"},"required":false},{"in":"query","name":"product_type","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Product Type"},"required":false},{"in":"query","name":"parent_id","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Parent Id"},"required":false},{"in":"query","name":"cursor","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Cursor"},"required":false},{"in":"query","name":"limit","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Limit"},"required":false}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProductPageOut"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not Found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Content","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationErrorOut"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}}},"description":"The project's products, keyset-paged by id (``limit`` ≤ 200).\n\nBulk lookup: ``ids`` or ``skus`` (comma-separated, up to 200 each).\nIncremental sync: ``updated_since`` (ISO-8601) returns products modified\nat or after that instant — page until ``has_more`` is false, then store\nthe highest ``updated_at`` you saw. Further filters: ``category_id``\n(direct membership), ``status``, ``product_type``, ``parent_id``\n(variants of a configurable product). Requires ``products:read``.","tags":["Products"],"security":[{"ProjectApiKeyAuth":[]}]},"post":{"operationId":"public_v1_create_product","summary":"Create a product","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":128,"pattern":"^[!-~]+$"},"description":"Reuse this key for retries of the same write. Scoped to this API key; retained for 30 days, after which the key may be reused. Different requests with the same key return 409."}],"responses":{"201":{"description":"Created","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProductOut"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not Found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"413":{"description":"Content Too Large","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Content","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationErrorOut"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}}},"description":"Create one product. ``sku`` is required and must be unique within the\nproject (409 ``sku_conflict``). Every other field is optional; see the\nschema for the writable set — ``main_image``, ``product_type`` and\n``parent`` are not writable here. ``category_ids`` must belong to this\nproject and ``attributes`` keys must be attribute codes of this project\n(422 ``unknown_category`` / ``unknown_attribute``). Creating a product\nthe owner's plan has no room for is a 403 ``product_limit_exceeded``.\nRequires ``products:write``.","tags":["Products"],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProductCreateIn"}}},"required":true},"security":[{"ProjectApiKeyAuth":[]}]}},"/api/public/v1/products/{product_id}":{"get":{"operationId":"public_v1_get_product","summary":"Read one product","parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"product_id","schema":{"title":"Product Id","type":"integer"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProductOut"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not Found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Content","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationErrorOut"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}}},"description":"One product with its attribute values and category ids. A product\noutside this project is a 404, never a 403. Requires ``products:read``.","tags":["Products"],"security":[{"ProjectApiKeyAuth":[]}]},"patch":{"operationId":"public_v1_update_product","summary":"Update a product","parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"product_id","schema":{"title":"Product Id","type":"integer"},"required":true},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":128,"pattern":"^[!-~]+$"},"description":"Reuse this key for retries of the same write. Scoped to this API key; retained for 30 days, after which the key may be reused. Different requests with the same key return 409."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProductOut"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not Found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"413":{"description":"Content Too Large","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Content","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationErrorOut"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}}},"description":"Partial update: only the fields present in the body change. ``sku``\nis not writable (it is the product's stable identity for integrations);\nneither are ``product_type``, ``parent``, ``main_image`` or system\nfields — sending one is a 422. ``category_ids`` replaces the category\nset; ``attributes`` touches only the codes sent (``null`` removes a\nvalue). A no-op body returns the unchanged product. Requires\n``products:write``.","tags":["Products"],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProductUpdateIn"}}},"required":true},"security":[{"ProjectApiKeyAuth":[]}]},"delete":{"operationId":"public_v1_delete_product","summary":"Delete a product","parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"product_id","schema":{"title":"Product Id","type":"integer"},"required":true},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":128,"pattern":"^[!-~]+$"},"description":"Reuse this key for retries of the same write. Scoped to this API key; retained for 30 days, after which the key may be reused. Different requests with the same key return 409."}],"responses":{"204":{"description":"No Content"},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not Found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"413":{"description":"Content Too Large","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Content","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationErrorOut"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}}},"description":"Delete through the native product boundary, including history sidecars,\ncache invalidation and delete permissions. Requires ``products:delete``.","tags":["Products"],"security":[{"ProjectApiKeyAuth":[]}]}},"/api/public/v1/products/batch":{"post":{"operationId":"public_v1_batch_upsert_products","summary":"Create or update up to 200 products by SKU","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":128,"pattern":"^[!-~]+$"},"description":"Reuse this key for retries of the same write. Scoped to this API key; retained for 30 days, after which the key may be reused. Different requests with the same key return 409."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProductBatchOut"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not Found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"413":{"description":"Content Too Large","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Content","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BatchErrorOut"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}}},"description":"Upsert keyed by ``sku``: items whose SKU exists are updated, the rest\nare created. The batch is validated first and applied atomically — a\nduplicate SKU within the batch, an unknown category or attribute, an\ninvalid value or more creates than the plan allows returns 422\n``batch_invalid`` with one entry per offending item and **nothing is\nwritten**. On success every item is applied in one transaction and the\nresponse lists each item's ``id`` and whether it was ``created`` or\n``updated``. Retrying the same batch is idempotent. Requires\n``products:write``.","tags":["Products"],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProductBatchIn"}}},"required":true},"security":[{"ProjectApiKeyAuth":[]}]}},"/api/public/v1/categories":{"get":{"operationId":"public_v1_list_categories","summary":"List categories","parameters":[{"in":"query","name":"ids","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Ids"},"required":false},{"in":"query","name":"parent_id","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Parent Id"},"required":false},{"in":"query","name":"is_active","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Is Active"},"required":false},{"in":"query","name":"cursor","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Cursor"},"required":false},{"in":"query","name":"limit","schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Limit"},"required":false}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CategoryPageOut"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not Found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Content","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationErrorOut"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}}},"description":"The project's categories, keyset-paged by id, flat with ``parent_id``\nand ``level`` so a client can rebuild the tree. ``parent_id=0`` selects\nthe roots; ``ids`` is a comma-separated bulk lookup; ``is_active``\nfilters on the flag. Requires ``categories:read``.","tags":["Categories"],"security":[{"ProjectApiKeyAuth":[]}]},"post":{"operationId":"public_v1_create_categories","summary":"Create categories","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":128,"pattern":"^[!-~]+$"},"description":"Reuse this key for retries of the same write. Scoped to this API key; retained for 30 days, after which the key may be reused. Different requests with the same key return 409."}],"responses":{"201":{"description":"Created","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CategoryOut"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not Found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"413":{"description":"Content Too Large","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Content","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationErrorOut"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"}}}}},"description":"Create a resource through its native validation and mutation hooks.","tags":["Categories"],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PublicCategoriesCreateIn"}}},"required":true},"security":[{"ProjectApiKeyAuth":[]}]}},"/api/public/v1/categories/{category_id}":{"get":{"operationId":"public_v1_get_category","summary":"Read one category","parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"category_id","schema":{"title":"Category Id","type":"integer"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/comp